language that makes undue implications.Words to Watch: reveal, point out, clarify, expose, explain, find, note, observe, insist, speculate, surmise, claim, assert, admit, confess, deny, 
confirm ...
17. Euphemisms: Euphemisms should generally be avoided in favor of more neutral and precise terms.​Words to Watch: passed away, gave her life, eternal rest, make love, an issue with, 
